* LM358 dual operational amplifier macro-model (one amplifier per .SUBCKT LM358).
*
* Source: National Semiconductor (now Texas Instruments). This copy comes from the free-software
* model collection distributed with github.com/rene-dev/stmbl (hw/spice/LM358.lib).
* License: the original notice, kept below, allows copying and distribution (no reselling).
*
* Changes made in this repository (everything else is the original text):
*   1. The three POLY(1) sources (EOS, G1, F6) are rewritten as equivalent behavioural B sources.
*      ngspice implements POLY with the XSPICE code model spice2poly.cm, which is not available
*      in every ngspice installation (e.g. Ubuntu's libngspice0 package does not ship it).
*   2. The wrapper LM358_DUAL at the end puts two amplifiers into one package, in the pin
*      order of the KiCad symbol Amplifier_Operational:LM358 (see the pin_map in the examples).
*
